{
  "$shape": "src/data/audioRecipes.js RECIPES — same keys, same units, so these drop into the game's own table without a translation layer. The game has no audio files; every sound is synthesised.",
  "$voice": "Low and mechanical (02_ART_DIRECTION §10). No beeps, no chirps, no rising arpeggios. The whole set is one instrument: a small machined thing with a damped body. Silence is the default and the game ships muted.",
